|            Addition/subtraction FLOPS                                        |
|     :MULT_FLOPS                                                              |
|            Multiplication FLOPS                                              |
|     :DIV_FLOPS                                                               |
|            Division/Square-root FLOPS                                        |
|     :MAC_FLOPS                                                               |
|            Multiply-Accumulate flops. Each MAC operation is counted as 2 FLOP|
|            S. This event does not include bfloat MAC operations              |
