| rocp_sdk:::SQ_ACCUM_PREV                                                     |
|            This is a hardware register that can be used for accumulating valu|
|            es for other counters. This is useful in expressions where you wan|
|            t to integrate over time. Only accumulates once every 4 cycles. Th|
|            is counter is primarily for use with derived counters supplied by |
|            rocprof.                                                          |
|     :DIMENSION_INSTANCE=0                                                    |
|             Range: [0-0], default=sum.                                       |
|     :DIMENSION_SHADER_ENGINE=0                                               |
