|            t to integrate over time. This counter is primarily for use with d|
|            erived counters supplied by rocprof.                              |
|     :DIMENSION_INSTANCE=0                                                    |
|             Range: [0-0], default=sum.                                       |
|     :DIMENSION_SHADER_ENGINE=0                                               |
