| rocp_sdk:::SQ_INSTS_SMEM_NORM                                                |
|            Number of SMEM instructions issued normalized to match the level o|
|            f memory accessed (i.e. scratch, global, etc). This normalized val|
|            ue is designed to give a hint of high cost memory actions being us|
|            ed. The formula used to calculate this value is the following (INS|
|            T_COUNT *2 for load/store; INST_COUNT*2 atomic; INST_COUNT*2 memti|
|            me; INST_COUNT*4 wb/inv). This value is returned per-SE (aggregate|
|             of values in SIMDs in the SE).                                   |
|     :DIMENSION_INSTANCE=0                                                    |
|             Range: [0-0], default=sum.                                       |
|     :DIMENSION_SHADER_ENGINE=0                                               |
|             Range: [0-23], default=sum.                                      |
|     :DIMENSION_XCC=0                                                         |
|             Range: [0-5], default=sum.                                       |
|     :device=0                                                                |
|             Range: [0-3], default=0.                                         |
