|            eframe (for dispatch profiling this is the timeframe of kernel exe|
|            cution, for agent profiling it is the timeframe between start_cont|
|            ext and read counter data) with less than 16 threads. A sum of all|
|             SQ_WAVES_LT_16 values will give the total number of waves with 16|
|             threads enqueued during the collection timeframe by the applicati|
|            on. Returns one value per-SE (aggregates of SIMD values). Useful f|
|            or checking for wavefront occupancy.                              |
|     :DIMENSION_INSTANCE=0                                                    |
|             Range: [0-0], default=sum.                                       |
